# Promotion: Sergeant Major's reply kinds at Naja Salaheem (no script, no default): each Progress line against Private
# First Class's 5001 (an Event), in GM-made states out of play order (the lookup ranks only the actions up at the talk).
# The containers run in file order (Chief Sergeant, Corporal, First Lieutenant, Lance Corporal, Private First Class,
# Second Lieutenant, Sergeant, Sergeant Major, Superior Private): an Event tie would play Private First Class's 5001
# first. Main (Sergeant completed, AssaultPromotion 25, Private First Class accepted by a GM): 5048 over 5001; then each
# Stage set by a GM with Prog 0 (a day before today): 5049, 5050, 5051, 5052, 5053, 5054 over 5001; 5054 finished:
# completed; then 5001.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionLanceCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass accepted
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5048 (Progress) over 5001 (Event)
finish option=3                         # begun; Stage 0, Prog today
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM: the day passed
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # Stage 0: 5049 over 5001
finish option=3
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM
charvar Quest[6][95]Stage 1             # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5050 over 5001
finish option=2
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM
charvar Quest[6][95]Stage 2             # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5051 over 5001
finish option=3
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM
charvar Quest[6][95]Stage 3             # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5052 over 5001
finish option=3
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM
charvar Quest[6][95]Stage 4             # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5053 over 5001
finish option=3
charvar Quest[6][95]Prog 0              # a GM
charvar Quest[6][95]Stage 5             # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5054 over 5001
finish                                  # completed
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 5001 alone
finish
